    "long_instructions": "TODOs:\r\n- review the plan for the page\r\n- examine the AI-generated result\r\n- click on the parts of the result that match the plan\r\n- decide whether to 'Keep', 'Redirect', or 'Edit' the result\r\n- click your chosen decision button\r\n- observe the sample page's response to your decision",
